        "blast_url": "https://blast.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/Blast.cgi?PAGE_TYPE=BlastSearch&PROG_DEF=blastn&BLAST_SPEC=GDH_GCA_949752845.1",
        "comments": "The assembly mHypAmp2.1 is based on 28x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, retained haplotig separation with purge_dups, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using rapid curation. This alternate haplotype assembly combines the haplotigs separated by purge_dups with haplotigs separated from the primary assembly during curation. The X chromosome was identified based on alignment with Mesoplodon densirostris (GCA_025265405.1). The order and orientation of contigs in the following regions is uncertain: SUPER_2, 131 Mb to 140 Mb; SUPER_6, 91 Mb to 102 Mb and SUPER_7, 76 Mb to 81 Mb.",
